        "subheading": "Get It Customized",
        "heading": "18 KARATS <em>Custom</em> Creations",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text_highlight": "serif",
        "text": "<p>18 KARATS specializes in custom creations, from custom engagement rings to one-of-a-kind statement jewelry. We make the process seamless — and fun. Simply reach out to us with your idea or request a special order, and we’ll work with you to create digital renderings of your custom piece complete with revisions and your choice of any metal, stone, style, and size. </p><p>No idea is too bold, no request too detailed! At 18 KARATS, it’s all about creating jewelry that’s as unique as you.</p>",
